        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 年前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "氣氛不太好，但作為一家本地酒吧，也算不錯了。他們允許室內吸煙，這一點讓人很反感。酒水種類豐富，味道也相當不錯，食物選擇也很多。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The vibes are NOT there, but for a local bar it’s not too bad. They do allow smoking indoors which was quite a turn off. Drinks are pretty good with a lot of variety and they have various food options as well.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
